<title>FRANCE: Lafarge 1996 sales up 6.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Lafarge 1996 sales up 6.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					35,262    vs   33,218</p>
<p>NOTE - Lafarge issued its 1996 sales in a statement. It said sales rose 6.2 percent, or 5.6 percent at constant currency rates.</p>
<p>It said activity improved in the second half after a difficult start to the year. In the fourth quarter, activity was still depressed in western Europe, recovering in central Europe and Canada, but strong in the United States and newly industrialised countries.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
